  "policies": {
    "dash": "Distance=min(native maxDistance,current distance to target), fixed angle, speed=buffSpeedUp, per-step cap100ms, collision radius=skillSize[0], one hit per target, blocks on water/static/player structures. Radius interpretation, travel stopping and path algorithm not proven retail.",
    "suctionTiming": "English native description says after 2 seconds; SkillScheme.duration=1600 differs. Chosen description delay2000ms after cast. This conflict is explicit, not claimed exact retail timing.",
    "suctionMotion": "Linear interpolation minSuction..maxSuction by distance, max100ms integration, 60-unit stop gap; bosses anchored, known immune-control/immune-repel buffs skip pull; native cone and args. Motion curve, boss immunity policy and interrupt behavior reconstructed.",
