    "hurricanes": "Native description specifies TWO; entityType1053 and prefab recovered from client. Parallel spacing=skillSize[0] total, speed/range from SkillScheme; each projectile can strike same enemy once, including overlap of both hurricanes. Pair spacing, overlap rule and radius policy not proven retail.",
    "collision": "City and player structure rays use current server collider reconstruction; no new edits to Stage44 walls. Pet hurricanes ignore resource farming and respect safe target areas.",
    "retry": "Each target object marked only after damage settlement; failed remainder retries after250ms. Already successful targets are not damaged again; impact target list is frozen at first impact.",
    "recovery": "skillBackswing keeps pet from starting another skill after action; cancel on modes, confusion, owner death, recycle, mount and same-map portal.",
    "portals": "One-time companion transfer near owner with dry non-colliding 160/240/80/0 offsets; fallback withdraw preserving life/HP if no placement. IDs, HP, life and ready cooldown map retained; active attacks/old shots cancelled. Placement/transfer policy reconstructed.",
    "motion": "Native state events drive animations. This proves event binding, not full Windows rendering. Current follow/target algorithm remains local.",
    "fullParity": "All other limitations from Stage50 remain. Normal ranged fox/hamster/owl projectiles, compound pet attacks/pacts, broader game mechanics and full delivery/controller recovery are still incomplete."
